**四层证据体系（FourLayerEvidenceSystem）：**

| 层级 | 证据类型 | 核心指标 |
|------|---------|---------|
| 事件层 | EventLayerEvidence | event_strength_score, event_continuity_score, strong_event_count_7d, event_recency_days |
| 龙头层 | LeaderLayerEvidence | leader_alive_score, leader_breakdown_flag, relay_strength_score, front_row_survival_ratio |
